. *----------------------------------------------------------------------------
> ---
. * 4. SECONDARY GRAPH: event study (firm fixed effects + year dummies)
. *    Year dummies are year fixed effects; firm FE absorb CA, so "ca" is omitt
> ed.
. *    Each CA x year coefficient = CA-TX gap in ln(mktcap) in that year minus 
> the
. *    gap in 2018.
. *----------------------------------------------------------------------------
> ---
. forvalues t = `firstyr'/`lastyr' {
  2.     if `t' != `refyr' {
  3.         gen yrdum`t'    = (pyear == `t')
  4.         gen caXyrdum`t' = ca * yrdum`t'
  5.     }
  6. }

. 
